cc:RE_Panahi_ThisIsNotAFilm a cc:CreativeResponse,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cc:dataProvenance "documented case" ;
    cc:description "Panahi and Mojtaba Mirtahmasb made a self-reflexive video diary largely inside Panahi's apartment. Panahi stages and describes an unproduced screenplay and turns the conditions of being forbidden to make films into part of the film's subject and form." ;
